Creative coloring games for kids will help your child learn more about colors and coloring itself. Let your child become a real artist and develop new talents. Coloring book for kids includes coloring activity which is friendly to the youngest and focuses on different objects that are surrounding kids everyday. Furthermore, these games for kids contain a lot of coloring tools that will entertain your child with fascinating sounds and funny animations. The following is waiting for you:

- 9 topic packs with 144 coloring pages;
- Easy coloring book for kids;
- Different coloring tools for customizing;
- Creativity development.

Games for girls and boys are designed for children of preschool age and also suitable as games for toddlers of 2- 4 years old. All the activities were developed with participation of experts in the field of children education and include such educational games for girls and boys as fine motor skills and logic development. Enjoy!

Version 4.0 of the NAUI Worldwide ® Mobile App continues to build on the great functionality NAUI divers and dive professionals have come to expect from the NAUI App. Directly linked to NAUI CORE (Certifications; Online training; Resources; and Educational material), NAUI divers and dive professionals can no access key functionality directly from the app allowing them access to important resources anywhere on from their mobile device. The ability to find the closest NAUI dive store and get step by step street directions is just one of the powerful features made possibly by utilising mobile technology. Feature Include the following:
•	NAUI Members and Affiliates
o	Access to CORE profile
o	Dashboard with certification, course and dive statistics (if applicable);
o	Achievements (digital badges display case);
o	Access to latest news and events;
o	Direct access to regional NAUI store for all purchases.
o	Access to certification and digital C-Cards;
o	Direct access to eLearning courses;
o	Ability to manage and certify students directly from the App;
o	Locate and verify dive professionals and affiliates;
o	Various dive tools including ODIGTML planner;
o	Digital dive logs;
o	Access to membership and membership resources including digital credential card;
o	Authorised courses and access to authorised courses instructor cards; and
o	Ability to track and manage activation codes.
•	NAUI Divers
o	Access to CORE profile
